---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_AUTHOR } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于"
  description={`关于 ${SITE_AUTHOR}`}
  bannerTitle="关于"
  bannerSubtitle={`关于 ${SITE_AUTHOR}`}
  bannerImage="/img/banner-about.jpg"
  bannerHeight="80vh"
>
  <div class="board">
    <div class="board-inner">
      <div class="about-head">
        <img src="/img/avatar.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="about-avatar" />
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">{SITE_AUTHOR}</h1>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">算法 · 前端</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="about-quote">
        "生活的90%都取决于你如何对待！你要保持专注，看到事物光明的一面！我是不知道光明的一面是什么样啦，但你应该能找到的"
        <span class="about-quote-by">——Anna</span>
      </blockquote>

      <p class="mt-8 text-lg">喜欢编程，人菜瘾大，一事无成，这样的人生。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .about-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .about-avatar {
      width: 5rem;
      height: 5rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .about-quote {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--muted) 5%, var(--surface));
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.9;
    }
    .about-quote-by {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      text-align: right;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
